10. Let the applicant- Dharmendra Kaushal be released on bail in the aforesaid case, on furnishing a personal bond and two sureties each in the like amount to the satisfaction of magistrate/court concerned, subject to following conditions:-
(i) the applicant shall not tamper with the prosecution evidence;
(ii) the applicant shall not pressurize the prosecution witnesses;
(iii) the applicant shall appear on each and every date fixed by the trial court (Subhash Vidyarthi,J.) Order Date :- 19.9.2023 Preeti.

Dharmendra Kaushal vs State Of U.P. Thru. Prin. Secy. Home ... on 19 September, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/164943795/
